<view class="page">
  <view class="header"><view class="eyebrow">SHUTTLEKIT / VENUE OPS</view><view class="title">球馆实时球速</view><view class="subtitle">每一拍，都有训练反馈。</view></view>
  <view class="card setup"><view class="section-title">连接场地</view><view class="fields"><input placeholder="球馆 ID" value="{{venueId}}" bindinput="onVenueInput" /><input placeholder="场地 ID" value="{{courtId}}" bindinput="onCourtInput" /></view><button class="primary" bindtap="connectSession">{{connected ? '已连接 · 重新连接' : '连接实时会话'}}</button><view class="status {{connected ? 'status-on' : ''}}">{{statusText}}</view></view>
  <view class="metrics"><view class="metric metric-main"><text>当前球速</text><view>{{currentSpeed}}</view><text>km/h</text></view><view class="metric"><text>本场峰值</text><view>{{peakSpeed}}</view><text>km/h</text></view><view class="metric"><text>有效样本</text><view>{{sampleCount}}</view><text>次</text></view></view>
  <view class="card"><view class="section-title">模拟击球</view><view class="note">用于验证大屏与小程序链路；真实摄像头识别接入后，按钮会替换为自动数据。</view><view class="shot-row"><button bindtap="simulateShot" data-speed="90">训练球<text>90</text></button><button bindtap="simulateShot" data-speed="180">平抽球<text>180</text></button><button class="hot" bindtap="simulateShot" data-speed="320">杀球<text>320</text></button></view><button class="reset" bindtap="resetSession">清空本场数据</button></view>
  <view class="card equipment-card"><view class="section-title">装备推荐</view><view class="note">使用本地结构化样本库，展示推荐理由和数据来源，不依赖实时爬取。</view><view class="equip-fields"><picker range="{{equipmentCategories}}" range-key="label" value="{{equipmentCategoryIndex}}" bindchange="onEquipmentCategoryChange"><view class="picker">类型：{{equipmentCategories[equipmentCategoryIndex].label}}</view></picker><input type="number" placeholder="预算（元）" value="{{equipmentBudget}}" bindinput="onEquipmentBudgetInput" /></view><view class="equip-fields"><picker range="{{equipmentLevels}}" value="{{equipmentLevelIndex}}" bindchange="onEquipmentLevelChange"><view class="picker">水平：{{equipmentLevels[equipmentLevelIndex]}}</view></picker><picker range="{{equipmentStyles}}" value="{{equipmentStyleIndex}}" bindchange="onEquipmentStyleChange"><view class="picker">打法：{{equipmentStyles[equipmentStyleIndex]}}</view></picker></view><button class="primary" bindtap="recommendEquipment">生成装备推荐</button><view wx:if="{{equipmentLoading}}" class="status">正在匹配…</view><view wx:for="{{equipmentResults}}" wx:key="item.id" class="equip-result"><view class="equip-name">{{item.brand}} {{item.model}}</view><view class="equip-price">{{item.priceText}} · 匹配分 {{score}}</view><view class="equip-reason">{{reasonsText}}</view><view class="equip-source">来源：{{item.source}}</view></view></view>
</view>
